The flight data logic in packages/flightwall_core (OpenSky state-vector
fetching, AeroAPI flight lookup, FlightWall CDN name lookup, and the
geographic helpers) is a Dart port of that project's ESP32 firmware, with
modifications: anonymous OpenSky access, per-callsign caching of AeroAPI
results, selection of the airborne flight leg, parallel lookups, and
TLS certificate verification.

